ubuntu@ubuntu:~/My File.txt

man ls-b
Description:shows file names with special characters escaped.
ls -b > output.txt
Arduino  Documents  Music     Public     Videos
Remarks:It escapes spaces and special characters with \.

man ls -c
Description:sort by, and show, ctime (time of last  change
             of file  status  information);  with -l: show ctime and
             sort by name.
ls -c > output.txt
output.txt
Remarks:It does not show special details by itself,it just cahneges the order of files.

man ls -d
Description:list directories themselves, not their contents.
ls -d > output.txt
.
Remarks:lists only the directory name themselves instead of showing everything inside them.

man ls -f
Description:List all entries in directory order.
ls -f > output.txt
.
..
output.txt
Remarks:The outputs are not sorted alphabetically.

man ls -g
Description:like -l, but do not list owner.
ls -g > output.txt
total 4
-rw-rw-r-- 1 ubuntu 2 Aug 28 16:22 output.txt
Remarks:only the group name is displayed and the owner name is hidden.

man ls -h
Description: with -l and -s, print sizes like 1K 234M 2G etc.
ls -lh
total 4.0K
-rw-rw-r-- 1 ubuntu ubuntu 11 Aug 28 17:29 output.txt
Remarks: makes file size easy to read by showing KB,MB,GB instaed of long byte numbers.

man ls -i
Description: print the index number of each file
ls -i > output.txt
33410 output.txt
Remarks: shows inode numbers  which are unique IDs for files in the filesystem.

man ls -l
Description: with -l and -s, print sizes like 1K 234M 2G etc.
ls -l > output.txt
total 4
-rw-rw-r-- 1 ubuntu ubuntu 11 Aug 28 17:29 output.txt.
Remarks: shows the complete details of files.

man ls -m
Description: fill width with a comma separated list of entries
ls -m > output.txt
output.txt
Remarks: shows files in one line separated by commas.

man ls -n
Description: like -l, but list numeric user and group IDs.
ls -n > output.txt
total 4
-rw-rw-r-- 1 1000 1000 11 Aug 28 17:39 output.txt
Remarks:It shows numeric user and group IDs instead of names.

man ls -o
Description:like -l, but do not list group information.
ls -o > output.txt
total 4
-rw-rw-r-- 1 ubuntu 11 Aug 28 17:39 output.txt
Remarks: Hides the group column ,showing only the owner.


man ls -p
Description:append / indicator to directories
ls -p > output.txt
output.txt
Remarks: helps to easity identify folders by adding a / at the end of their names

man ls -q
Description:print ? instead of nongraphic characters
ls -q > output.txt
output.txt
Remarks:helps avoid display problem caused by strange characters in the file names

man ls -r
Description:reverse order while sorting
ls -r > output.txt
output.txt
Remarks:lists files in reverse order.

man ls -s
Description:print the allocated size of each file, in blocks
ls -s > output.txt
total 4
4 output.txt
